# The engagement runner's payload is shipped bytes, not an install artifact: a
# packaged app executes these files from its own resources, so they have to be in
# the tree even where a repository-wide rule would drop them — `node_modules/`
# for the dependency closure, and `coverage/`, which is a runner MODULE under
# dist/ here. Regenerated with `node apps/desktop/scripts/vendor-redteam-runner.mjs`.
!apps/desktop/resources/redteam-runner/
!apps/desktop/resources/redteam-runner/**
